  "description": "Under the attention filter, an expectation targeted by an ignore whose @until is unordered with the cutoff is listed among open work's ambiguous entries, in place of open or upcoming, unless an ignore in effect also targets it. A date cutoff of 5 June is unordered with a 17:00 @until that day: Door 101 (outstanding) and Door 104 (not yet due) are ambiguous, Door 102 stays omitted through a second ignore without @until, and the unignored Door 103 is open. At 17:00 the first ignore is in effect, and at 17:01 it has lapsed. Without the filter every expectation is listed as usual, and the ignore changes no standing.",
